{"3859880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CRAWLER", "steam_appid": 3859880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/8385e0905fc7329cb0c8f0576ae091a5.avif?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">CRAWLER is a <strong>Co-op VR Horde Shooter</strong> where you and a friend are intergalactic exterminators, hired to clear an alien infestation on a crimson, rocky planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pilot your six-legged Mech through <strong>randomly generated missions</strong>, as you complete distinct objectives for your employer and exterminate hordes of bugs. With your earnings, return to home base and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a global deadline that decreases whenever your in a mission, you must act quickly if your to meet the ever growing <strong>Company Quota</strong>. As it rises, <strong>expect new environments and threats</strong> to make themselves known. Die, then run it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/b56c247329456c2d8581f43ebb3ea43c.webp?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/4b909831762acce23a85cdfc4c7f3251.poster.avif?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/4b909831762acce23a85cdfc4c7f3251.webm?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/4b909831762acce23a85cdfc4c7f3251.mp4?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blast them to pieces, Crush them underfoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command a <strong>six-legged Mech</strong> built for extermination as you face off against endless hordes of alien vermin that spit, swarm and explode in a satisfying squelch. Combat in <i>CRAWLER</i> is intense, overwhelming, and <strong>engrossingly satisfying.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/241d125dad3b351601ca4cb9ab0ce441.webp?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.poster.avif?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.webm?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.mp4?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the quota! (or buy upgrades)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Following each mission, return to base. Here you can <strong>select new missions</strong>, submit your quota and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech, from quick-firing mini-guns, to head tracked defense weaponry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/3bda375df268fa2bc5d3ac1f311c9839.webp?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/79bb401ee3a9ce8ee8ec31c50116de1a.poster.avif?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/79bb401ee3a9ce8ee8ec31c50116de1a.webm?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/79bb401ee3a9ce8ee8ec31c50116de1a.mp4?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>...But most importantly, exterminate with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>CRAWLER </i>is designed around chaotic co-op action with <strong>two players</strong>. One brawls as the driver, while the other strikes from the turret. <strong>Communication</strong> and <strong>teamwork</strong> are mandatory for optimal bug extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/c557b5cf91c20749733459545c553ab5.avif?t=1787451746\" width=617 height=301 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: