/span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Blast them to pieces, Crush them underfoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command a <strong>six-legged Mech</strong> built for extermination as you face off against endless hordes of alien vermin that spit, swarm and explode in a satisfying squelch. Combat in <i>CRAWLER</i> is intense, overwhelming, and <strong>engrossingly satisfying.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/241d125dad3b351601ca4cb9ab0ce441.webp?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.poster.avif?t=1787451746\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.webm?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859880/extras/d60f695f9cc113c7065df56a40612ea3.mp4?t=1787451746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet the quota! (or buy upgrades)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Following each mission, return to base. Here you can <strong>select new missions</strong>, submit your quota and <strong>purchase new upgrades</strong> for your mech, from quick-firing mini-guns, to head tracked defense weaponry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share